Package: dictinstant
Version: 0.1.0
Section: education
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3
Maintainer: Dariush Khosrowan <dariush@khosrowan.ir>
Description: Instant multi-source dictionary definitions, examples and pictures
 Shows many definitions of a word from different free dictionaries at once —
 with example sentences and pictures — so you choose the meaning that clicks.
 .
 Features:
  * Independent definitions from the Free Dictionary API and Wiktionary
  * Automatic pictures from Wikimedia Commons
  * Pronunciation audio, examples, part-of-speech
  * "Choose this" saves meanings to your personal review list
  * Open source (MIT), uses free data sources
